    - target: {fileID: 2858776301035975273, guid: f6fc4fc5ea45e894695bc2d81b5f6385,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Transform your game scenes into deeply immersive, rain-soaked environments
        with DYNAMIC - Dripping Rain\u2014the powerful, easy-to-use system that lets
        you place dripping rain effects in your environments. Whether it\u2019s rain
        dripping  from the edges of rooftops, or dripping from a character or item
        that\u2019s moving through the environment, this system is built to deliver
        an unparalleled level of immersion, realism, with total creative control
        and customization.\r\n\nEasy Placement:\r\nEasily place and customize the
        size of dripping rain spawn points. These can be placed on the edge of buildings,
        NPC\u2019s, the Player or other surfaces where rain would drip from. Allowing
        you to specify exactly where or what rain should drip from.\r\n\r\nCustomizable
        Look and Feel:\r\nOur system gives you the freedom to customize the look
        and feel of the dripping rain to your heart's content.  Whether it be heavy
        drops falling from ledges or fine mist dripping through trees our system
        can create it all.\r\n\r\nOptimized for Huge or Small Environments:\r\nBuild
        the atmosphere and worlds you desire with no compromise in image fidelity
        and performance . As our smart spawning system and Unity Object Pooling takes
        care of the heavy lifting by reducing the amount of dripping rian VFX  that
        can be in the scene at once. \r\n\nEdit Mode Preview:\r\nVisualize the dripping
        rain effects directly in the editor with one-click preview, to see exactly
        how the effects will appear at runtime\u2014no surprises. As the in-game
        spawning system only works in playmode.\r\n\nBuild Mode Optimized:\r\nAutomatically
        optimizes dripping rain spawn points in build mode by removing all components
        used for debugging. \r\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2858776301035975273, guid: f6fc4fc5ea45e894695bc2d81b5f6385,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
